        "TileImage": "$($repository 2e1a30c5-b1e0-4984-b3f4-67f01f9ebfef).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Your target is Akira Nakamura, the Director of the GAMA Private Hospital located in the Hokkaido region. Nakamura has been misusing the resources provided by Kronstadt Industries to conduct highly experimental and illegal medical treatments at the GAMA facility. Our client, Kronstadt Industries, has hired us to eliminate Nakamura, and to put an end to his incompetence. I&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
